@startuml semantic-evolution-lifecycle
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title CR-VAS-010: Semantic Evolution Lifecycle (Classification -> Versioning -> Release -> Migration)

state "Change Proposed" as CP
state "Classify (9 classes)" as CL
state "Impact Analysis (5 dimensions)" as IA
state "Migration Class (M0..M4)" as MC
state "SemVer (MAJOR / MINOR / PATCH)" as SV
state "Release Manifest" as RM
state "Compatibility Reported" as CR

CP --> CL : problem_statement + classification
CL --> IA : semantic_rationale + affected_invariants
IA --> MC : change_classification + migration_requirements
MC --> SV : migration_class + compatibility_impact
SV --> RM : version + changes[] + migration
RM --> CR : compatibility {semantic, schema, conformance, instance, mapping}

note right of CL
  Per CR-VAS-010 §3
  Classification MUST reflect actual impact,
  not diff size. 9 classes incl. Multi.
end note

note right of IA
  Per CR-VAS-010 §8
  Compatibility MUST be evaluated across
  Definition, Instance, Schema,
  Conformance, Mapping.
end note

note right of MC
  Per CR-VAS-010 §14
  M0 No / M1 Mechanical / M2 Reviewed
  M3 Semantic / M4 Requalification Required
end note

note right of SV
  Per CR-VAS-010 §4
  SemVer is a release convention.
  Compatibility MUST be assessed
  and evidenced (SV-INV-002).
end note

@enduml
